<title>USA: Rohm and Haas Sept 30 Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Rohm and Haas Sept 30 Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.31		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net		 85,000		   57,000</p>
<p> Sales	     969,000		  942,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  64,718		   67,466</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $4.28		    $3.24</p>
<p> Net		 282,000		  219,000</p>
<p> Sales	     3,017,000		2,969,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  65,930		   67,587</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Rohm and Haas Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said per-share data included the effects 3.5 million share repurchase since January 1, 1996. The nine-month earnings comparison included a $0.25 per share charge in the first quarter 1995 for cleanup of a Myerstown, Penn waste disposal site and a $0.15 per share gain in the second quarter 1996 as a result of retroactive tax credits related to sales outside the United States.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
